      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "product-authoring-assistant\ndata-product-name-advisor\ndata-product-schema-advisor\ndata-product-spec-writer\nWhat they do:\nGuide PO through ODCS spec\nauthoring. Suggest names, schema\ncolumns, quality rules. Preview\ngap check vs available sources.\nNeo4j: writes :DataContract\n:DataContractSchema\n:PropertyShape (rules)",
