      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "data-discovery\ndata-discovery-mysql\ndata-profiling\ndata-profiling-to-dqv-neo4j\nWhat they do:\nExtract schema from source DB.\nStatistical column profiling. FK\nrelationship discovery. Write full\ncatalog to Neo4j.\nNeo4j: writes :Catalog\n:Dataset \u00b7 :Column\n:ProfilingRun \u00b7 :ColumnProfile",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "data-discovery\ndata-discovery-mysql\ndata-profiling\ndata-profiling-to-dqv-neo4j\nWhat they do:\nExtract schema from source DB.\nStatistical column profiling. FK\nrelationship discovery. Write full\ncatalog to Neo4j.\nNeo4j: writes :Catalog\n:Dataset \u00b7 :Column\n:ProfilingRun \u00b7 :ColumnProfile",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
