      "originalText": "data-product-gap-analyzer\ndata-product-archetype-classifier\ndata-product-discovery-advisor\nodcs-to-graph\nWhat they do:\nGap analysis: can spec columns be\nsourced? Classify product archetype.\nSuggest source candidates. Persist\nODCS spec to Neo4j graph.\nNeo4j: writes :DataContract v2\n:CONSUMES edges\n:DataContractSchema confirmed",
