      "text": "data-mapping-neo4j\ndata-serving-virtual-view\ndata-product-spec-to-dprod-neo4j\ndata-mapping-rationale-summarizer\nWhat they do:\nAI maps source \u2192 target columns.\nFK inference for join construction.\nDDL view generation + deployment.\nMapping rationale report.\nNeo4j: writes :ColumnMapping\n:DProdDataProduct\n:ServingDefinition",
