      "text": "data-product-question-analyzer\ndata-product-question-executor\ndata-scoring (OSI readiness)\ndata-product-osi-advisor\nWhat they do:\nGenerate + execute QA questions\nagainst deployed views. OSI score.\nReadiness assessment before publish.\nMarketplace enrichment.\nNeo4j: writes :QAEvaluation\n:OSIScore\n:DataContract {lifecycle: published}",
