      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Captures every step of the journey: Discovery \u2192 Profiling \u2192 Enrichment \u2192 Product spec \u2192 Mappings \u2192 Views \u2192 Publication\nContext graph: all artifacts and their interdependencies in one queryable knowledge store\nLight Domain Ontology (business concepts) \u00b7 PROV-O provenance on every decision \u00b7 Explainability & traceability\nOntologies: SHACL \u00b7 PROV-O \u00b7 DCAT-2 \u00b7 W3C \u00b7 Custom product graph\nInsight Extraction Engine reads from here \u2192 improves agent playbooks + skills (feedback loop)",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Captures every step of the journey: Discovery \u2192 Profiling \u2192 Enrichment \u2192 Product spec \u2192 Mappings \u2192 Views \u2192 Publication\nContext graph: all artifacts and their interdependencies in one queryable knowledge store\nLight Domain Ontology (business concepts) \u00b7 PROV-O provenance on every decision \u00b7 Explainability & traceability\nOntologies: SHACL \u00b7 PROV-O \u00b7 DCAT-2 \u00b7 W3C \u00b7 Custom product graph\nInsight Extraction Engine reads from here \u2192 improves agent playbooks + skills (feedback loop)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
